Subject: [PATCH 1322/3799] soh: rename func_809839AC ->
 DemoIk_Type1SetupAnimate

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the type 1 cue-3 handler: switches to action mode 2 with the shadow on and the animation rewound.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c
index 8445dbfa6..856b2fb70 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c
@@ -199,7 +199,8 @@ void DemoIk_Type1SetupAppear(DemoIk* this, PlayState* play) {
     this->skelAnime.curFrame = 0.0f;
 }
 
-void func_809839AC(DemoIk* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809839AC: the type 1 cue-3 handler: switches to action mode 2 with the shadow on and the animation rewound.
+void DemoIk_Type1SetupAnimate(DemoIk* this) {
     this->actionMode = 2;
     this->drawMode = 1;
     this->actor.shape.shadowAlpha = 255;
@@ -222,7 +223,7 @@ void func_809839D0(DemoIk* this, PlayState* play) {
                     DemoIk_Type1SetupAppear(this, play);  // was func_8098394C [LLM:HIGH]
                     break;
                 case 3:
-                    func_809839AC(this);
+                    DemoIk_Type1SetupAnimate(this);  // was func_809839AC [LLM:HIGH]
                     break;
                 case 4:
                     Actor_Kill(&this->actor);
